    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700804/2017008040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺から見ても、今までとは全然違って\r\nすごく自然にできてたよ。何かあったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008040150,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "え？\r\n別に……何もないっすよ",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700804/2017008040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？　舞台の上ではほんとにマーガレットに見えた",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008040160,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "うーん……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700804/2017008040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008040170,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "出てる人達がみんな衣装着て\r\n舞台セットの前に立ったら……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700804/2017008040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008040180,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そしたら、なんかカチッと音がしたっす",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700804/2017008040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nよかったな、あさひ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、本番まで足に気を……\r\n……あ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
